# Force LF line endings on checkout regardless of platform. Without this,
# Windows checkouts convert committed LF files (everything in this repo,
# including src/generated/**, is written with LF) to CRLF, which makes
# `declarify check` report every generated file as drifted purely from line
# endings — not a real content difference. Caught by real Windows CI
# (docs/09-decisions.md, DCL-0007).
* text=auto eol=lf
